      "translation_input": "2025年十月十八日，一场沙尘风暴使太阳能输出在十五分钟内下降百分之三十四电池柜温度升高八摄氏度，逆变器风扇还出现异常低频振动。控制器没有关闭整座电站，而是断开非必要加热装置、降低部分照明功率并启动各用发电机。诊断模块随后提出三个可能原因：太阳能板被碎肩遮挡、风扇轴承磨损以及电池连接器的接触电阻上升。",
      "translated_text": "On October 18, 2025, a dust storm caused solar output to drop by 34 percent in fifteen minutes, the temperature of the battery cabinet to rise eight degrees Celsius, and the inverter fan to vibrate at an abnormally low frequency. Instead of shutting down the entire power plant, the controller disconnects unnecessary heating devices, lowers the power of some lighting and starts up the various generators. Diagnostic modules then suggested three possible causes: the solar panels were shrouded by broken shoulders, fan bearing wear, and the contact resistance of the battery connector was elevated.",
