      "translation_chunk_count": 8,
      "translation_input": "风暴减弱后，技术员用头戴式摄像设备读取铭牌、序列号和报警代码. 本地处理单元再与离线维护手册进行比对。由于资料涉及关键基础设施图像没有上传云端。采集程序先确认整个标签位于安全边界内，并分别检查全图和上部区域的清晰度：若画面被载切，耳机会提示向左、向右或向后移动。目标只有连续四帧稳定且文字足够清楚时才会保存。第二天的日志表明，自动排序与人工判断一致先清理面板，再更换风扇轴承，最后紧固电池端子。处置用了六分钟，关键服务未中断。这说明可靠的自动化必须解释判断、承认不确定性，并把最终决定留给人。",
      "translated_text": "After the storm subsided, technicians used head-mounted cameras to read the insignia, serial numbers and alarm codes. The local processing unit is then compared to the offline maintenance manual. Images of critical infrastructure are not uploaded to the cloud. The capture process first confirms that the entire label is within the safe boundary and checks the clarity of the entire image and the upper region separately: if the image is cut, the earpiece is prompted to move left, right or backwards. The target is saved only when the sequence of four lines is stable and the text is clear enough. The next day's logs showed that the automatic sorting was consistent with the artificial judgment of cleaning the panels, replacing the fan bearings, and finally tightening the battery terminals. The disposal took six minutes and critical services were not interrupted. This shows that reliable automation must interpret judgments, acknowledge uncertainty, and leave the final decision to humans.",
